%% Red -> frozen -> green evidence flow. Rendered by hand as evidence-flow.html.
flowchart LR
    A[implement-tests] --> B[Orchestrator runs red checks]
    B -->|Import, syntax, compile, startup error| X[Rejected: not red evidence]
    B -->|Expected tests fail on assertions| C[Test-file hashes recorded]
    C --> D[implement]
    D --> E[Orchestrator runs green checks]
    E -->|Frozen test changed| Y[Stops the run]
    E -->|All checks pass| F[Green evidence bound to the diff fingerprint]
    F --> G[Any later change]
    G --> H[Delivery re-runs the checks]
